00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.820
- The last game didn't
really finish actually.

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:28.020
- It did.
- It didn't finish.

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:29.597
- I won, I won.
- So, you didn't quite.

00:09:29.597 --> 00:09:31.763
- No, I did.
- It's a tie now.

00:09:33.201 --> 00:09:34.034
- No, no!

00:09:34.034 --> 00:09:35.261
I won.

00:09:35.261 --> 00:09:38.330
We just got done playing
this super fun game,

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:39.630
and look who I ran into,

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:40.463
Rich!

00:09:40.463 --> 00:09:41.528
- What's up?
- Hello!

00:09:41.528 --> 00:09:42.361
What did you think?

00:09:42.361 --> 00:09:43.340
- I thought it was awesome.

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:45.374
Just to see that world
that you can't really see

00:09:45.374 --> 00:09:46.207
in real life is very strange

00:09:46.207 --> 00:09:49.820
to be playing a game that's not existing

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:50.970
in front of you.

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:51.803
But I really like it.

00:09:51.803 --> 00:09:54.380
It took me a little bit to
get the hang of it, though.

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:58.073
- Look, just got a camera person.

00:09:58.073 --> 00:10:00.640
- Look, you can go hands free.

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:01.473
- I know,

00:10:01.473 --> 00:10:02.306
it's magical.

00:10:02.306 --> 00:10:03.270
Well it's good to see you.

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:04.740
I feel like I run into you randomly

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:06.064
at all these random events.

00:10:06.064 --> 00:10:07.145
- Usually Apple events.

00:10:07.145 --> 00:10:07.978
- Usually, yes.

00:10:07.978 --> 00:10:09.208
- Usually once a year,

00:10:09.208 --> 00:10:10.041
twice a year,

00:10:10.041 --> 00:10:11.700
even though we live half
an hour from each other.

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:12.533
- It's true, yeah,

00:10:12.533 --> 00:10:13.989
in L.A.,

00:10:13.989 --> 00:10:15.047
but we see each other elsewhere.

00:10:15.047 --> 00:10:15.880
- That's how it is.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.350
We take two hours to
get to anywhere in L.A.,

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:18.920
even if you're a mile away.

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:20.880
- What was your favorite
thing from the keynote?

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:21.713
- To me,

00:10:21.713 --> 00:10:22.960
my personal favorite was actually

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:25.130
that we can now have Google Maps and Waze

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:25.963
on CarPlay.

00:10:25.963 --> 00:10:26.796
- Me too.

00:10:26.796 --> 00:10:27.807
- Nobody's really caring about it,

00:10:27.807 --> 00:10:30.250
except me because I love Apple Maps.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:32.203
I think it looks so beautiful and flowy,

00:10:32.203 --> 00:10:34.390
but sometimes I just want my Google Maps.

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:35.223
- It's true, yeah,

00:10:35.223 --> 00:10:36.056
I love CarPlay.

00:10:36.056 --> 00:10:36.889
I love it so much,

00:10:36.889 --> 00:10:37.722
so I was excited about that.

00:10:37.722 --> 00:10:38.900
- It's the greatest thing ever.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.480
- I was most excited about

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:42.380
being able to track yoga workouts

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:43.890
on the Apple watch.

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:45.230
- And now it's all automatic,

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:46.550
and you don't have to start anything.

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:48.450
The phone is just doing everything.

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:49.917
You don't have to think anymore, right?

00:10:49.917 --> 00:10:50.760
- Yes, it's so great.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:51.990
- I'm looking forward to that, too.

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:52.920
- There's so many fun things.

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:53.927
Well it's good to see you.

00:10:53.927 --> 00:10:54.760
- Not the yoga,

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:55.690
just the automatic tracking.

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:56.523
- Well maybe you should think about it.

00:10:56.523 --> 00:10:59.054
- I don't think I could stretch like that.

00:10:59.054 --> 00:11:01.270
- I guess that brings
my WWDC vlog to a close,

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:02.810
I'll be doing a bigger recap

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:04.080
and talking about some of the other things

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.520
that I've seen here and of course

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:06.400
the announcements,

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:07.790
but for now that's the end of the vlog,

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:08.900
and I will see you guys soon.

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:09.733
Hope you guys enjoy it.

00:11:09.733 --> 00:11:11.200
I had the absolute best time.

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:12.033
I'll see you later.

00:11:12.033 --> 00:11:12.871
Bye!

00:11:12.871 --> 00:11:15.788
(futuristic music)

